        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "That godly saint Valmiki composed the legend of Rama, the legatee of Raghu, exactly as the divine-soul Narada narrated it earlier. [1-3-9]"
      }
